WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:04.070
<b><i>Fighting is currently escalating
in the eastern part of the city,</i></b>

00:04.070 --> 00:07.660
<b><i>as Benerit Group mobile suits
open fire on housing complexes...</i></b>

00:07.660 --> 00:08.980
<b>Spacian bastards...</b>

00:09.670 --> 00:11.990
<b>You take from me again...!</b>

00:12.970 --> 00:14.280
<b>It's all my fault.</b>

00:16.430 --> 00:18.280
<b>I...</b>

00:18.280 --> 00:19.910
<b>did this.</b>

00:20.520 --> 00:21.750
<b>Hurry, dammit!</b>

00:21.750 --> 00:22.790
<b>That jerk...</b>

00:22.790 --> 00:25.210
<b>We're gonna arrest Shaddiq!</b>

00:25.210 --> 00:26.630
<b>Calm down!</b>

00:26.630 --> 00:28.890
<b>Just as President Miorine said,</b>

00:28.890 --> 00:33.840
<b>the first step is to reach Asticassia
and secure President Sarius!</b>

00:33.840 --> 00:37.560
<b>We still have no evidence that
Shaddiq Zenelli is the ringleader.</b>

00:37.560 --> 00:40.310
<b>You mustn't get ahead of yourself!</b>

00:42.210 --> 00:43.560
<b>Shaddiq...</b>

00:43.560 --> 00:46.400
<b>I'll never forgive you for this.</b>

00:47.880 --> 00:50.860
<b><i>Henao, contact the Space Assembly League.</i></b>

00:51.340 --> 00:52.660
<b><i>It's time to move my father.</i></b>

00:52.660 --> 00:53.650
<b>Roger.</b>

00:54.140 --> 00:57.360
<b>I told you we should make the first move!</b>

00:57.360 --> 01:00.240
<b>Renee! Don't misunderstand our objectives.</b>

01:00.240 --> 01:02.340
<b>You were so close to making it.</b>

01:02.340 --> 01:04.000
<b>I've gotta hand it to Miss Miorine.</b>

01:04.000 --> 01:06.920
<b><i>No, this wasn't Miorine.</i></b>

01:06.920 --> 01:09.290
<b>Shaddiq, are you angry?</b>

01:11.360 --> 01:12.250
<b>Guel...</b>

01:13.530 --> 01:15.010
<b>Where are you now?</b>

02:53.550 --> 02:56.620
<b>What's the Aerial doing on Earth?</b>

02:57.150 --> 02:59.080
<b>Who's piloting it?</b>

02:59.080 --> 03:02.960
<b>From this image data, it looks like
GUND-Bits are controlling nearby machines,</b>

03:02.960 --> 03:05.110
<b>but the Aerial's GUND-Bits themselves--</b>

03:04.020 --> 03:05.790
<b>D-Don't ask me!</b>

03:05.790 --> 03:07.870
<b>We're as surprised as you!</b>

03:07.870 --> 03:10.590
<b>You're useless. Why are you here then?</b>

03:10.590 --> 03:14.750
<b>I-I'd like to report...
I patched things up with everyone.</b>

03:14.750 --> 03:16.840
<b>Please answer my questions.</b>

03:20.780 --> 03:23.260
<b>How many complaints do we have now?</b>

03:23.260 --> 03:25.100
<b>I've lost count.</b>

03:25.100 --> 03:28.810
<b>Our mobile suit wreaked havoc while
we claim to be a medical company...</b>

03:28.810 --> 03:30.350
<b>It's no wonder.</b>

03:31.250 --> 03:33.990
<b>Well, if we can't see,
we can't reply to them.</b>

03:33.990 --> 03:37.150
<b>Leave it to the President!
I don't care anymore!</b>

03:38.430 --> 03:40.200
<b>Even Lilique is mad...</b>

03:40.200 --> 03:42.110
<b>What happens to the company now?</b>

03:42.970 --> 03:44.910
<b>Should we be good and go to class?</b>

03:44.910 --> 03:46.420
<b>Like her...</b>

03:46.420 --> 03:51.670
<b>It cannot be denied that concern
for pilot life support was extremely low</b>

03:51.670 --> 03:54.420
<b>in the early years of space development.</b>

03:55.410 --> 03:57.550
<b>In the view of historians,</b>

03:57.550 --> 04:02.890
<b>humanity's advancement into space
was fairly hasty and aggressive.</b>

04:02.890 --> 04:04.220
<b>And the loss of so many lives...</b>

04:09.540 --> 04:11.930
<b>None of that was in today's lecture.</b>

04:12.580 --> 04:15.350
<b>If you attend class
but don't bother to listen...</b>

04:15.350 --> 04:17.280
<b>what's the point?</b>

04:19.220 --> 04:22.540
<b>It's the only thing...
I can think of doing.</b>

04:25.390 --> 04:26.960
<b>This is today's portion.</b>

04:27.430 --> 04:28.960
<b>The Rumble Ring...</b>

04:28.960 --> 04:32.790
<b>If you hadn't been there,
Mr. Lauda might have died.</b>

04:32.790 --> 04:36.720
<b>If that happened... I don't know
what would become of me.</b>

04:39.070 --> 04:42.100
<b>Are you in love with Mr. Lauda?</b>

04:42.660 --> 04:46.090
<b>There! You always get on
everyone's nerves like that!</b>

04:47.740 --> 04:48.720
<b>Brother!</b>

04:48.720 --> 04:50.690
<b>Lauda! Where's the Darilbalde?</b>

04:50.690 --> 04:51.520
<b>It's here with me.</b>

04:52.000 --> 04:54.980
<b>But why bring a mobile suit off-campus?</b>

04:54.980 --> 04:58.400
<b>And what's that other one
I saw at the company--</b>

04:59.340 --> 05:01.320
<b><i>Permet ID codes detected.</i></b>

05:01.320 --> 05:04.450
<b><i>Five of them.
Mobile suits belonging to Grassley.</i></b>

05:05.470 --> 05:09.740
<b>What business do Cathedra forces have
at our school?</b>

05:09.740 --> 05:12.950
<b><i>Well, you see...
we received certain information...</i></b>

05:13.440 --> 05:16.840
<b>and we'd like you
to allow us to enter the campus.</b>

05:16.840 --> 05:19.000
<b><i>In that case, we'll handle it for you.</i></b>

05:19.000 --> 05:20.930
<b><i>Please explain the details.</i></b>

05:20.930 --> 05:22.640
<b>Why is Shaddiq...?</b>

05:24.110 --> 05:25.820
<b><i>Brother!</i></b>

05:25.820 --> 05:26.930
<b><i>Shaddiq!</i></b>

05:27.340 --> 05:29.980
<b>Where are you hiding President Sarius?!</b>

05:29.980 --> 05:33.730
<b><i>Weren't you told to secure your target
before you're suspected?</i></b>

05:33.730 --> 05:36.060
<b>It's because you're so rash...</b>

05:36.060 --> 05:37.310
<b><i>that Miorine has...!</i></b>

05:40.330 --> 05:42.570
<b><i>Come any closer, and I'll open fire!</i></b>

05:45.470 --> 05:48.860
<b>You're the one who started this!</b>

05:52.140 --> 05:54.510
<b>Did you remove the regulation program?!</b>

05:57.350 --> 05:58.710
<b><i>Damn it...</i></b>

05:58.710 --> 06:00.830
<b>he played right into his hands.
Let's move out!</b>

06:01.120 --> 06:02.340
<b><i>Copy that!</i></b>

06:01.120 --> 06:02.340
<b><i>Copy that!</i></b>

06:08.200 --> 06:10.320
<b><i>We won't let you get in Shaddiq's way.</i></b>

06:13.430 --> 06:18.100
<b><i>Time to show us how much better
you are than the school boys!</i></b>

06:21.340 --> 06:22.140
<b><i>Shaddiq?</i></b>

06:22.140 --> 06:22.730
<b><i>It's fine.</i></b>

06:22.730 --> 06:23.740
<b><i>Henao...</i></b>

06:23.740 --> 06:26.160
<b>I've secured him.
What about the other three?</b>

06:26.160 --> 06:27.650
<b><i>Let them go.</i></b>

06:27.650 --> 06:29.630
<b><i>We have no more reason to hide them.</i></b>

06:31.140 --> 06:34.450
<b><i>But we'll use the witch
for as long as we can.</i></b>

06:41.530 --> 06:46.260
<b><i>This is Kenanji Avery, a commander
in Cathedra's Dominicus force.</i></b>

06:46.260 --> 06:49.800
<b>All students, stay where you are.</b>

06:51.490 --> 06:54.400
<b>These tremors... is it a mobile suit?</b>

06:55.160 --> 06:56.350
<b>The door opened?</b>

07:05.220 --> 07:06.440
<b>That fool!</b>

07:16.310 --> 07:17.160
<b>Thorn!</b>

07:19.770 --> 07:20.250
<b>Norea!</b>

07:21.480 --> 07:22.710
<b>Don't do it, Norea!</b>

07:23.250 --> 07:25.420
<b>Why pilot a Gundam again?</b>

07:25.420 --> 07:27.430
<b>It's none of your business!</b>

07:27.430 --> 07:30.270
<b>If you're afraid to die, then run!</b>

07:30.270 --> 07:33.630
<b>Run... and then what?</b>

07:33.630 --> 07:38.270
<b>Because of you Spacians' brutality,
everyone I knew is dead!</b>

07:40.250 --> 07:43.100
<b>Not even Naji... or Olcott...</b>

07:44.090 --> 07:46.060
<b>and especially not you...
could ever understand...</b>

07:46.060 --> 07:50.740
<b>our anger that our lives
are cheaper than Spacians'!</b>

08:02.270 --> 08:04.710
<b>Sophie... let's demolish it.</b>

08:05.480 --> 08:08.840
<b>The entire school... and everything else!</b>

08:20.390 --> 08:22.640
<b>Reinforcements? From Grassley?</b>

08:29.980 --> 08:34.110
<b>Begone... begone... begone...</b>

08:34.110 --> 08:36.450
<b>All of this... disappear!</b>

08:41.870 --> 08:43.330
<b>It's a Gundam?!</b>

08:43.330 --> 08:44.710
<b>Gundvolvas!</b>

08:56.280 --> 08:58.100
<b>Hey... aren't those...</b>

08:58.100 --> 08:59.850
<b>The ones from the Open Campus...</b>

08:59.850 --> 09:01.730
<b>You don't think... it's Norea?!</b>

09:11.680 --> 09:13.200
<b>My Demi Tray!</b>

09:13.200 --> 09:15.500
<b>The surface is dangerous...
Get underground!</b>

09:18.220 --> 09:20.380
<b>Idiot! Get moving!</b>

09:22.310 --> 09:24.800
<b>What are you doing? Do you want to die?</b>

09:25.150 --> 09:26.540
<b>I-I'm sorry!</b>

09:31.650 --> 09:34.020
<b>This is the worst...</b>

09:34.020 --> 09:37.010
<b>It's all because Mr. Lauda
stood me up on our date.</b>

09:37.010 --> 09:38.440
<b>Am I right?</b>

09:38.440 --> 09:39.930
<b>R-Right!</b>

09:40.970 --> 09:45.430
<b>An apology won't be enough.
He's gonna take me wherever I ask!</b>

09:45.430 --> 09:48.610
<b>He owes me a lunch and a dinner!</b>

09:48.610 --> 09:51.260
<b>I won't be able to
rest in peace, otherwise.</b>

09:51.840 --> 09:52.990
<b>What about you?</b>

09:52.990 --> 09:54.860
<b>What will you do if you survive?</b>

09:55.640 --> 09:59.760
<b>I definitely...
want to be at his side again!</b>

10:05.810 --> 10:07.460
<b><i>This is a message to the entire front.</i></b>

10:07.460 --> 10:10.680
<b>Terrorist mobile suits have appeared
in the campus area!</b>

10:10.680 --> 10:11.840
<b>Send backup!</b>

10:19.830 --> 10:22.480
<b>You Witch Hunters are has-beens!</b>

10:26.580 --> 10:31.480
<b>I've had enough of you Gundams!</b>

10:33.090 --> 10:36.140
<b><i>Were you the one
who guided the Dawn of Fold?</i></b>

10:36.140 --> 10:37.110
<b><i>Yes.</i></b>

10:37.110 --> 10:39.200
<b><i>And the one who set my dad up?</i></b>

10:39.200 --> 10:40.200
<b><i>Yes.</i></b>

10:40.200 --> 10:42.990
<b>And the one who blamed it all
on the Jeturk Company?!</b>

10:45.290 --> 10:46.640
<b><i>That's right.</i></b>

10:47.220 --> 10:50.290
<b><i>Your father approached us with a plan
to assassinate Delling...</i></b>

10:50.290 --> 10:52.250
<b>and I used it to my advantage!</b>

10:57.880 --> 11:01.230
<b><i>Factional in-fighting and intrigues...</i></b>

11:01.230 --> 11:04.720
<b><i>He was a shallow man
with nothing else on his mind.</i></b>

11:04.720 --> 11:06.220
<b><i>A man like that...</i></b>

11:07.530 --> 11:10.310
<b>Don't you dare insult my father!</b>

11:12.250 --> 11:14.900
<b>But weren't you the one who killed...</b>

11:15.380 --> 11:16.990
<b><i>that father?</i></b>

11:19.090 --> 11:20.580
<b>My brother...</b>

11:21.510 --> 11:23.080
<b>killed Dad?</b>

11:25.530 --> 11:28.600
<b><i>A Level 5 alert has been issued</i></b>

11:28.600 --> 11:31.600
<b><i>for all sectors of the school front.</i></b>

11:31.600 --> 11:34.350
<b><i>The lives of students and staff
are under direct threat,</i></b>

11:34.350 --> 11:36.940
<b><i>and the situation is extremely dangerous.</i></b>

11:36.940 --> 11:39.020
<b><i>Except for security control personnel,</i></b>

11:39.020 --> 11:41.340
<b><i>act immediately as per
the emergency evacuation manual</i></b>

11:41.340 --> 11:43.390
<b><i>and please prioritize
your own physical safety.</i></b>

11:46.970 --> 11:49.450
<b><i>We're using the catapult at Gate 7!</i></b>

11:49.450 --> 11:51.560
<b><i>Any nearby students, stay clear!</i></b>

11:51.560 --> 11:53.480
<b>Mr. Lauda... Petra...</b>

11:53.480 --> 11:55.420
<b>where have they gone?</b>

11:55.420 --> 11:56.780
<b><i>Felsi!</i></b>

11:56.780 --> 11:59.880
<b>That thing's configured for campus use.
Don't go out too far!</b>

11:59.880 --> 12:00.690
<b><i>Right!</i></b>

12:01.190 --> 12:03.380
<b>It's up to me.</b>

12:03.900 --> 12:06.220
<b>Felsi Rollo... moving out!</b>

12:06.580 --> 12:11.680
<b><i>A Level 5 alert has been issued
for all sectors of the school front...</i></b>

12:08.740 --> 12:11.680
<b>Norea... why would you do this?</b>

12:11.680 --> 12:13.460
<b>Aliya! Lilique!</b>

12:15.960 --> 12:17.230
<b>Martin...</b>

12:17.230 --> 12:18.980
<b>Is everyone okay?!</b>

12:18.980 --> 12:21.050
<b>We haven't found Suletta yet.</b>

12:21.050 --> 12:23.900
<b>Damn it! If I had my Demi Tray...</b>

12:23.900 --> 12:25.700
<b>It's no good! You couldn't sortie now!</b>

12:25.700 --> 12:27.890
<b>We can't hide in here forever either!</b>

12:27.890 --> 12:30.960
<b>I don't want you to die, Chuchu!</b>

12:30.960 --> 12:34.900
<b>Well, at this rate,
it's a bad ending for all of us.</b>

12:34.900 --> 12:36.580
<b>No way...</b>

12:36.580 --> 12:38.080
<b>So I guess...</b>

12:38.730 --> 12:40.920
<b>we should loan you our machine.</b>

12:42.490 --> 12:46.260
<b><i>MSJ-R122... Demi Barding.</i></b>

12:46.260 --> 12:48.930
<b>It's Burion's new prototype.</b>

12:48.930 --> 12:51.410
<b>We brought it here for testing, but...</b>

12:51.410 --> 12:53.350
<b>None of us is a pilot,</b>

12:53.350 --> 12:57.500
<b>so letting that Pom-Pom Head use it
gives us some chance of survival, right?</b>

12:57.500 --> 12:59.690
<b>Come on. Hurry up and fine-tune it.</b>

12:59.690 --> 13:02.020
<b>Fine-tune? But...</b>

13:02.020 --> 13:04.280
<b>Chuchu's machine is always tuned by...</b>

13:06.760 --> 13:08.200
<b>Nika?</b>

13:09.710 --> 13:11.010
<b>And there she is!</b>

13:11.010 --> 13:13.370
<b>Just the person we need.</b>

13:15.800 --> 13:16.940
<b>Everyone...</b>

13:19.060 --> 13:21.400
<b>Nika, you have to
calibrate this right away.</b>

13:21.400 --> 13:22.750
<b>What?</b>

13:22.750 --> 13:26.530
<b>Can we talk to each other one more time?</b>

13:27.730 --> 13:29.050
<b>Right.</b>

13:29.050 --> 13:31.840
<b>Come on, come on!</b>

13:31.840 --> 13:32.790
<b>Come on!</b>

13:33.780 --> 13:35.430
<b>The power output is different,</b>

13:35.430 --> 13:38.080
<b>but the controls
should feel the same as always.</b>

13:39.370 --> 13:42.670
<b>I'm sorry, Chuchu... this is all my fault.</b>

13:42.670 --> 13:45.530
<b>That you have to go and fight too...</b>

13:46.330 --> 13:47.930
<b>How can I forgive you?</b>

13:50.050 --> 13:52.030
<b>Tell me everything from A to Z.</b>

13:52.470 --> 13:55.910
<b>Otherwise, there's nothing to forgive.</b>

13:56.340 --> 13:57.480
<b>Yeah...</b>

14:01.360 --> 14:03.190
<b>Th-This is bad...</b>

14:03.190 --> 14:04.190
<b><i>At this rate...</i></b>

14:12.490 --> 14:13.790
<b><i>Hey, Spacian!</i></b>

14:13.790 --> 14:16.470
<b>Y-You! Is that Pom-Pom Head?</b>

14:16.470 --> 14:18.790
<b><i>Help me out. We're gonna smash them all!</i></b>

14:19.950 --> 14:22.310
<b><i>I ain't taking orders from an Earthian!</i></b>

14:26.170 --> 14:28.130
<b><i>You pathetic students!</i></b>

14:29.340 --> 14:31.090
<b><i>Sabina! Go!</i></b>

14:31.710 --> 14:33.430
<b><i>Help Shaddiq!</i></b>

14:34.080 --> 14:36.180
<b>We've saved the best part for you!</b>

14:36.180 --> 14:37.420
<b><i>Thanks.</i></b>

14:51.450 --> 14:54.660
<b>If you'd acted more wisely,
your father wouldn't have died.</b>

14:55.700 --> 14:57.660
<b><i>If you'd never come back...</i></b>

14:57.660 --> 15:00.640
<b><i>I could have dissolved
the Group peacefully!</i></b>

15:03.450 --> 15:05.280
<b>Despite your being with her...</b>

15:05.690 --> 15:08.170
<b>you let Miorine's hands get dirty!</b>

15:08.840 --> 15:11.680
<b><i>To hell with a traitor who
collaborated with terrorists!</i></b>

15:11.680 --> 15:14.420
<b><i>And who turned me into that?</i></b>

15:14.420 --> 15:17.350
<b><i>The ones who stole everything
through war partitioning...</i></b>

15:17.350 --> 15:20.680
<b>Who forced us to survive
at the expense of others...</b>

15:20.680 --> 15:21.980
<b><i>It was all of you!</i></b>

15:22.600 --> 15:25.970
<b><i>Without power, there's no way
to break this unjust peace.</i></b>

15:26.730 --> 15:28.670
<b><i>No way to even resist it....</i></b>

15:29.070 --> 15:33.410
<b>That's why this time, I'll take the power
from you Spacians myself!</b>

15:34.990 --> 15:38.200
<b><i>I... am ready to accept my own sins!</i></b>

15:44.410 --> 15:46.460
<b><i>I've got President Sarius aboard the ship.</i></b>

15:46.960 --> 15:49.670
<b><i>If you can buy 5 more minutes...</i></b>

15:49.670 --> 15:52.650
<b>we can leave for our rendezvous point
with the Assembly League.</b>

15:52.650 --> 15:53.820
<b>I see.</b>

15:58.050 --> 15:59.760
<b><i>I know what you mean...</i></b>

15:59.760 --> 16:03.960
<b>You and I... each have to
bear our own sins by ourselves.</b>

16:03.960 --> 16:06.400
<b>But even so... you'll pay for yours here!</b>

16:06.400 --> 16:07.770
<b><i>Shaddiq!</i></b>

16:07.770 --> 16:09.710
<b>Charging straight in...</b>

16:10.270 --> 16:14.300
<b>That's the very thing
I've always hated about you!</b>

16:19.280 --> 16:20.150
<b>Sabina!</b>

16:24.870 --> 16:28.250
<b>Guel Jeturk, you'll never understand.</b>

16:28.250 --> 16:31.460
<b>You grew up
with a silver spoon in your mouth!</b>

16:36.170 --> 16:38.470
<b><i>You're the one who doesn't understand.</i></b>

16:38.470 --> 16:40.100
<b>Guel!</b>

16:42.230 --> 16:43.520
<b>If all you do is take...</b>

16:44.010 --> 16:45.900
<b>you'll never gain a thing!</b>

16:51.280 --> 16:52.110
<b><i>Shaddiq!</i></b>

17:08.500 --> 17:10.590
<b><i>I'll never forgive you.</i></b>

17:10.590 --> 17:13.920
<b>But I'm not about to let you die, either.</b>

17:15.670 --> 17:21.410
<b>To maintain order, the Benerit Group
sacrificed fellow Spacians at the school.</b>

17:22.220 --> 17:26.160
<b><i>The Assembly League wouldn't act
just because of Earthian losses...</i></b>

17:26.160 --> 17:28.100
<b><i>but they'll finally get off
their butts now.</i></b>

17:34.060 --> 17:36.320
<b>Oh, my foolish son...</b>

17:46.790 --> 17:48.780
<b>I'll destroy it all!</b>

17:48.780 --> 17:52.310
<b>Every last thing you call yours!</b>

17:59.550 --> 18:00.640
<b><i>Norea!</i></b>

18:02.630 --> 18:05.740
<b>That's enough. Don't be in a rush to die!</b>

18:08.900 --> 18:11.520
<b>And what do you get with all your running?</b>

18:12.480 --> 18:15.800
<b><i>You only hold your breath
and avert your eyes!</i></b>

18:15.800 --> 18:17.820
<b><i>That's no different from being dead!</i></b>

18:17.820 --> 18:20.820
<b>Sophie was alive! You're nothing like her!</b>

18:22.740 --> 18:25.290
<b>Obviously. But you're not Sophie either!</b>

18:27.120 --> 18:29.230
<b><i>Those drawings in your sketchbook...</i></b>

18:29.230 --> 18:30.790
<b><i>That's the real you!</i></b>

18:30.790 --> 18:33.000
<b><i>Anxious... terrified of death...</i></b>

18:33.690 --> 18:35.770
<b><i>Scribbling was your only escape!</i></b>

18:35.770 --> 18:36.840
<b>How would you know--</b>

18:36.840 --> 18:37.630
<b>Come with me!</b>

18:40.670 --> 18:43.900
<b><i>If you don't know how to live,
I'll search for that with you.</i></b>

18:43.900 --> 18:46.080
<b><i>If you're scared, I'll be at your side!</i></b>

18:46.080 --> 18:49.310
<b><i>If you don't want to run,
take me to the places in your drawings!</i></b>

18:50.180 --> 18:52.190
<b><i>The rest can come later!</i></b>

18:54.400 --> 18:56.190
<b><i>We're allowed to live...</i></b>

19:03.320 --> 19:05.470
<b>Let me prove it!</b>

19:11.490 --> 19:12.710
<b>They stopped?</b>

19:12.710 --> 19:14.650
<b>Have they turned on each other?</b>

19:18.000 --> 19:19.900
<b>With you...</b>

19:22.960 --> 19:25.220
<b><i>You say, "come with me..."
then "take me there..."</i></b>

19:25.820 --> 19:27.010
<b><i>Are you stupid or something?</i></b>

19:27.010 --> 19:28.050
<b>Norea!</b>

19:29.090 --> 19:30.830
<b><i>Tell me later...</i></b>

19:33.180 --> 19:34.750
<b>your...</b>

19:35.140 --> 19:36.270
<b>real name--</b>

20:02.470 --> 20:03.890
<b>Damn it...</b>

20:03.890 --> 20:05.780
<b><i>Get out of my way!</i></b>

20:11.090 --> 20:13.000
<b>Ow, that hurt...</b>

20:13.890 --> 20:15.770
<b>Ms. Petra? Ms. Petra!</b>

20:24.550 --> 20:29.290
<b>Episode 20</b>

21:19.200 --> 21:21.770
<b>This isn't a dream, is it?</b>

21:21.770 --> 21:24.130
<b>It's real. All of it.</b>

21:26.090 --> 21:27.050
<b>Tiko?</b>

21:30.340 --> 21:31.930
<b>Ms. Suletta!</b>

21:32.470 --> 21:34.850
<b>Thank goodness. You're alright!</b>

21:36.560 --> 21:37.620
<b>Suletta, I--</b>

21:37.620 --> 21:38.960
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

21:39.560 --> 21:41.360
<b>Can you help?</b>

21:43.480 --> 21:45.920
<b>There are people stuck inside.</b>

21:45.920 --> 21:48.870
<b>Still... so many...</b>

21:52.110 --> 21:56.020
<b>But there may be some
who can still be saved.</b>

21:58.660 --> 22:00.210
<b>Let's do it, everyone!</b>

22:00.210 --> 22:03.320
<b>I'll go find a working mobile craft.</b>

22:03.320 --> 22:05.650
<b>We'll need first aid too, right?</b>

22:05.650 --> 22:07.720
<b>We'll split up and save them!</b>

22:07.720 --> 22:09.160
<b>Right!</b>

22:07.720 --> 22:09.160
<b>Right!</b>

23:44.400 --> 23:45.350
<b><i>Next time,</i></b>

23:44.670 --> 23:48.990
<b>Episode 21</b>

23:45.350 --> 23:46.670
<b><i>"What We Can Do Now."</i></b>

23:48.990 --> 23:52.250
<b>Illustration: <i>Rolua</i></b>
